WEBVTT

00:02:29.328 --> 00:02:30.684
he leaned forward, and said,

00:02:30.684 --> 00:02:32.911
as reassuringly as he could,

00:02:32.911 --> 00:02:34.291
"Ah, don't worry about the buzzer,

00:02:34.291 --> 00:02:36.544
it doesn't work anyway."

00:02:36.544 --> 00:02:41.991
(Laughter)

00:02:43.472 --> 00:02:45.361
Over the subsequent months,

00:02:45.361 --> 00:02:49.446
we tested Joe and his fellow inmates,

00:02:49.446 --> 00:02:51.497
looking specifically at their ability

00:02:51.497 --> 00:02:56.481
to categorize different images of emotion.

00:02:56.481 --> 00:02:58.267
And we looked at their physical response

00:02:58.267 --> 00:03:00.009
to those emotions.